@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff
state CurrentTime

StartWatch:! --> CurrentTime : Start
CurrentTime: Adjust Hour --> HourAdjustment : Adjust Hour
HourAdjustment: Adjust Alarm Off --> AlarmOff : Adjust Alarm Off
AlarmOff: Adjust Alarm On --> AlarmOn[*] : Adjust Alarm On
AlarmOn[*]: Adjust Hour --> HourAdjustment : Adjust Hour
AlarmOn[*]: Adjust Minute --> MinuteAdjustment : Adjust Minute
MinuteAdjustment: Adjust Alarm Off --> AlarmOff : Adjust Alarm Off
MinuteAdjustment: Adjust Alarm On --> AlarmOn[*] : Adjust Alarm On
AlarmOn[*]: Light On --> LightOn[*] : Light On
LightOn[*]: Light Off --> LightOff : Light Off
LightOff: Light On --> LightOn[*] : Light On

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online College Magazine System

state LoginChoice
state AdminProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ContentCreation
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticle
state FeedbackProvided

LoginChoice:! --> AdminProfileManagement : Login
AdminProfileManagement: Admin Profile Management --> ContentCreation : Create/Edit User Profile
ContentCreation: Edit Articles --> Editing : Edit Articles
Editing: Publish Articles --> PublishedArticles : Publish Articles
PublishedArticles: Search for More Articles --> SearchArticle : Search for More Articles
SearchArticle: Provide Feedback --> FeedbackProvided : Provide Feedback
FeedbackProvided: Access Denied --> AccessDenied : Access Denied

title UML State Machine Diagram - Smart Traffic Management System

state TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state RuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid[*]
state WarningSent[*]

TrafficMonitoring:! --> RuleVerification : Monitor Traffic
RuleVerification: Record Violation --> ViolationRecorded : Record Violation
ViolationRecorded: Fine Paid --> FinePaid[*] : Fine Paid
ViolationRecorded: Warning Sent --> WarningSent[*] : Warning Sent

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Marketplace

state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state PurchaseDecision
state Logout

Registration:! --> Verification : Register
Verification: Verify Account --> SellerWorkspace[*] : Verify Account
SellerWorkspace[*]: Access Workspace --> SellerWorkspace : Access Workspace
SellerWorkspace: Add New Products --> ProductAddition : Add New Products
SellerWorkspace: Promote Existing Products --> ProductPromotion : Promote Existing Products
CustomerDashboard[*]: Access Dashboard --> CustomerDashboard : Access Dashboard
ProductExploration: Explore Products --> ProductViewing : Explore Products
ProductViewing: Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing --> PurchaseDecision : Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing
PurchaseDecision: Log Out --> Logout : Log Out
@enduml
